  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:HnMon">Hn mon</ref> 3.1</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="3.1" corresp="#wit-sc">Et si in ali[o] comitatu mutando denarios captus fuerit, captus sit ut falsonarius.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-sc">And if he has been seized recasting money in another county, he shall be regarded as a forger.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 284–285 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added</note>
      </div>
    </body>
